
note <the test DSL: one key head, `test`. `test <phrase>` names a test with a human phrase, then a flow of ordinary statements ending in an assertion (`want`). It lowers to the `test` meta object (a name and a work), which `run` executes. The body is plain Seed, so every kind of test (unit, functional, integration, e2e) is the same head with a different body.>

load @term/mill/code/code/tool/flow/mine
  find flow

load @term/mill/code/code/take/mine
  find take

mine test
  mine term, term test
    mine any
      mine text
        site name
      mine term
        site term
    mine list
      mine any
        mine form, like take
          site take
        mine form, like flow
          site work
